    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90041" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσσαίνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fawn upon, coax</i>, prop. of dogs, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1082
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς κέρκοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.422
				</span></i>
			: mostly metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἂν Ἀργείων τόδ᾽ εἴη φῶτα
					προσσαίνειν κακόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1665
				</span></i>
			 (troch.): c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῖς συνδείπνοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					3.99e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>please</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶνδε προσσαίνει σέ
			τι</span>; <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				835
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				863
			</span></i>.</div>
